          "message": {
            "text": "Native control snapshots must include author outline visual overflow, not just the host border box. The validation fixture uses :valid/:invalid outlines outside the themed input; expanding by outline width plus positive offset matches Blink's visual-overflow surface and makes 06-forms-validation-ui pixel-clean.",
