            "markdown": "A one-CSS-pixel visual-overflow fringe is sufficient and shared: the focused 06-forms-style-text-inputs run moved from 3 regions / 0.1302% coverage to 0 regions / 0% coverage, with raw diff 0.1432% to 0.00475%. The existing native-only branch still excludes appearance:none controls, and the same expanded rect drives both crop and stamp, avoiding image rescaling."
